  A native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m wrapped in a [38;5;153m<label>[39m — the label makes the text clickable too. On/off state is
  handled by the browser, so there's no JS or CSS needed.

  Notes:
  - The page had no framework, build step, or tests, so this is plain markup matching the existing file style.
  - "Task item" is a placeholder label. If items should come from data, or if you want checked items visually struck
    through or persisted across reloads, say the word — that's the next step but is past "nothing fancy."
  - Not verified in a browser; no test harness exists in the repo.

